  "metaDescription": "Budi Arie Setiadi completed a nine-hour questioning session with Bareskrim Polri regarding a treason case involving Listyo Sigit Prabowo and others.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Budi Arie Setiadi underwent nine hours of questioning by Bareskrim Polri investigators.",
    "The inquiry included 42 questions regarding a treason case involving Listyo Sigit Prabowo.",
    "Budi Arie stated that his past public remarks on the 2029 election timeline were not related to treason."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police's Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim Polri) is conducting an investigation into a treason case involving Listyo Sigit Prabowo and several other individuals. As part of this ongoing probe, Budi Arie Setiadi, the chairman of Projo, was recently summoned for questioning. Over the course of a nine-hour session, investigators posed 42 questions to him regarding the case. Following the questioning, Budi Arie publicly addressed the media, clarifying his position on statements he previously made concerning the acceleration of the 2029 election. He maintained that his analysis, including comments on political events, did not constitute treason. The investigation has drawn attention from political observers, including members of the PDIP, who have commented on the legal proceedings. Authorities are continuing to examine various aspects of the case, which also involves other individuals linked to the matter.",
